row timing_clock_source,auto (system),NULL,Resource Usage / Time,Controls the clock source used for collecting timing measurements.,This enables the use of specialized clock sources, specifically the RDTSC clock source on x86-64 systems (if available), to support timing measurements with lower overhead during EXPLAIN and other instrumentation.,superuser,enum,default,NULL,NULL,{auto,system,tsc},auto,auto,NULL,NULL,f
